  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! India -Tea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to optimize the bargaining position of tea farmers and workers in India by co-creating innovative traceability tools and platforms, and to empower them to have a meaningful participation in the design of national regulations that address social, environmental and governance issues of the value chain. contribute to a responsible and inclusive global tea value chain that ensures value is distributed fairly, smallholder tea farmers and workers benefit from decent working conditions, and tea is produced with respect to the environment.</narrative>
  </description>
